  unitName: Spirit Master Charis
  unitId: 60775
  unitNumber: 1055
  description: Wielder of the Sacred Dagger. There is a legend in Atharva that links
    the god of death to the guardian of the Sacred Treasures. It claims that whoever
    acquires knowledge of the treasures is met by a young man who comes from the
    darkness to pierce their heart. Story has it that a certain god wanted Charis
    to help keep this information secret from others, though no one knows to what
    end, nor why Charis did as he was commanded. The only thing that is certain is
    that the god granted him the Sacred Dagger so that he could carry out his task.
  summonDesc: I hate myself for wanting that, but I just can't stop myself. I'm a
    pain, aren't I?
  fusionDesc: You're strengthening me again? Guess a simple thanks isn't enough.
    What do you want me to do?
  evoDesc: You evolved me? That means even more work, right? Oh, I don't mean it
    in a bad way!
  element: 6
  rarity: 5
